== Effects ==
* Removes 15% of any enemy's health if they have 60 HP or higher.
* Gives Isaac one {{E|Red Heart}} if he enters an unexplored {{R|Boss Room}}.
* Once picked up, Tick can't be dropped or replaced with another trinket.

== Notes ==
* Only works on the first stage of multistage bosses.
* {{dlc|a}}[[Friendly]] enemies are also affected by the health removal when above 60&nbsp;hp.
* {{dlc+|anr}} This trinket's effect can be multiplied to a maximum of x2 through any combination of multiple copies and {{i|Mom's Box}}. This also includes multiplying the healing effect when entering a {{r|Boss Room}}.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} This trinket's effect can be stacked via any combination of multiple copies, golden variants, and {{i|Mom's Box}} with enough stacks causing any enemy above 60&nbsp;hp to have the lowest amount of health possible with any amount of damage killing them. This also includes stacking the healing effect when entering a {{r|Boss Room}}. The HP removal stacking effect is equal to 0.85 ^ Number of Tick Instances, with golden trinkets adding on 2 to this.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|r}} Has no effect on {{e|Mega Satan}}.
* {{dlc|r}} Has no effect on the [[Harbingers (Bosses)|Ultra Harbingers]]. Works on both phases of {{e|Dogma|n}}.{{dlc-}}
* Losing {{i|Mom's Purse}} or {{i|Belly Button}} (such as from an item re-roll) will drop Tick if it's in the second trinket slot.

== Synergies ==
* {{a|Golden Trinket}}: The golden version can be freely dropped or replaced by another trinket.
** {{a|Golden Trinket|r+}}/{{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either heals Isaac for 2 hearts when entering an unexplored Boss Room. Having both heals Isaac for 3 hearts.
* {{dlc+|a+}} {{i|Marbles}} / {{i|Smelter}} / [[Pills|Gulp!]]: Absorbs the trinket, allowing Isaac to pick another trinket up.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|a}} {{t|Match Stick}} / {{dlc+|r+}} {{t|A Lighter}}{{dlc-}}: Tick can be removed by picking up these trinkets.
** {{dlc+|nr+}} '''Match Stick''' + {{i|Mom's Purse}} / {{i|Belly Button}}: Match Stick can no longer remove Tick, instead moving to the second trinket slot even if Isaac already holds two trinkets.{{dlc-}}
* {{i|Mom's Box}}: Reduces enemy's health by 30%.

