== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|a}} Being able to replace the Tick with Match Stick is a reference to how one can remove a tick that has latched onto their skin in real life with a heated tip of a match stick; however, removing a tick like this can expose oneself to disease-causing bacteria present in the tick. It is also a feature that was carried over from the original ''The Binding of Isaac'', though it's unclear why it wasn't originally added in ''Rebirth''.
* The Tick is the only trinket that passively changes Isaac's appearance.
* The Tick bears similarity to a real-life deer tick.
* This trinket is used in [[The Host]] (challenge #18).

